    <briefdescription>
<para>Represents a cuboidal patch shape. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The <ref refid="class_cubic_patch" kindref="compound">CubicPatch</ref> class extends <ref refid="class_patch_shape" kindref="compound">PatchShape</ref> and provides functionality to define a patch using two points (bottom-left and top-right corners). It can generate an influence zone as a RingModel and a textual description of the patch. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
